  "wakeAlarmTitle": "Wake me up",
  "wakeAlarmHowItWorksTitle": "How it works",
  "wakeAlarmAndroidExplain": "Android can open GR Radio at the scheduled time and start your station, even if the app was closed. One-time alarms use the date you pick; daily and weekly alarms use the clock time (and weekdays for weekly). Allow “Alarms & reminders” (exact alarms) when asked, avoid force-stopping the app, and expect some OEMs to delay alarms if battery saving is aggressive.",
